WEBVTT

00:13:58.706 --> 00:14:02.424
el-ṭaqa el-dexlaniya elli fi datna -- nwesɛu el-ṭaqa elli fi datna – ki neɛɛerfu rwaḥtina,

00:14:02.424 --> 00:14:05.990
nestɛarfu w nexxedmu b el-xuf ntaɛna,

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:09.508
w ḥna dayrin el-zɛaf b mqam el-zit,

00:14:09.508 --> 00:14:12.073
nexxedmu mɛa ġirna,

00:14:12.073 --> 00:14:14.008
netlemmu mɛa ġirna,

00:14:14.008 --> 00:14:16.190
netšejɛu,

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:23.159
W el-muhhim gaɛ, nezzeɛmu beš nexxedmu bla-teɛnaf.

00:14:23.159 --> 00:14:27.273
Ḍerwek, ma raniš ġir n’emmen b el-bla-teɛnaf.

00:14:27.273 --> 00:14:30.208
Maniš meḥtaja n'emmen bih.